# General Application Architecture - Cursor Rules
## Extracted from Project Harvest - Applicable to Any Godot Project

This ruleset defines reusable architectural patterns for building maintainable, scalable applications in Godot. It is engine-specific but game-agnostic, focusing on systems architecture, UI patterns, and data management.

