## Integration with Game-Specific Rules

This ruleset is **complementary** to your game-specific rules. Apply these patterns for:
- Application infrastructure (managers, UI, saves, settings)
- Non-gameplay systems (menus, audio management, scene transitions)

Use your game-specific rules for:
- Gameplay logic (player, enemies, items, puzzles)
- Game mechanics (combat, inventory, progression)
- Domain-specific systems (game-specific managers)

Both rulesets share:
- Explicit typing requirements
- No ternaries, no `:=`
- Engine-first configuration
- Documentation standards
- Error handling expectations
- PascalCase files, snake_case functions (GDScript)

